xplr (1.1.2-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild against action-debian-build v1.10.0, which restores
    reproducibility. The installed example, examples/init.lua, came from
    upstream's tree and kept the checkout's mtime here while a rebuild from the
    .dsc took upstream's commit date from the orig tarball. dpkg-deb clamps only
    the newer of the two, so the two builds disagreed by one tar header.

